a %1 px wide viewport and switches to its mobile layout, which may break sign-in. Widen the widget by dragging its edge.":{"*":[""]},"Reset Zoom":{"*":[""]},"Zoom in / out":{"*":[""]},"Reset zoom":{"*":[""]},"Full screen (Esc exits)":{"*":[""]},"Navigate history":{"*":[""]},"Close find bar, settings or full screen":{"*":[""]},"Version %1":{"*":[""]},"AI assistants inside KDE Plasma":{"*":[""]},"ChatAI embeds the official web apps of AI assistants in a native Plasma widget, with a persistent profile, per-site permissions and a memory-conscious web engine lifecycle. It does not provide an AI API and does not bypass authentication or anti-bot protections.":{"*":[""]},"Repository:":{"*":[""]},"Report a problem:":{"*":[""]},"License:":{"*":[""]},"Authors":{"*":[""]},"Provider icons: Icons8, IconScout, Simple Icons (CC0) and the services' own brand assets. Trademarks belong to their owners.":{"*":[""]},"Keyboard shortcuts":{"*":[""]},"unknown":{"*":[""]},"custom":{"*":[""]},"These options are for troubleshooting. The defaults are the safe choice.":{"*":[""]},"Browser identity:":{"*":[""]},"Identify as Chromium (hide the Qt WebEngine token)":{"*":[""]},"Not recommended for Google accounts: Google rejects browsers that hide their identity (\"This browser or app may not be secure\") and accepts the honest Qt WebEngine identity. Enable only if a specific site refuses the Qt WebEngine token.":{"*":[""]},"Custom user agent:":{"*":[""]},"Leave empty for the default":{"*":[""]},"Custom user agent":{"*":[""]},"Resources:":{"*":[""]},"Freeze the page while the widget is hidden":{"*":[""]},"Pauses scripts of the hidden page after 30 seconds when the engine reports it is safe (no audio, upload or download). Resumes instantly on opening.":{"*":[""]},"Discard hidden page after:":{"*":[""]},"Never":{"*":[""]},"%1 minute":{"*":["",""]},"Discard hidden page after":{"*":[""]},"Discarding frees most memory but reloads the page on the next opening; unsent text is lost.":{"*":[""]},"Developer tools:":{"*":[""]},"Show \"Developer Tools\" in the ⋮ menu":{"*":[""]},"Diagnostics":{"*":[""]},"Refresh":{"*":[""]},"Copy Diagnostics":{"*":[""]},"No cookies, tokens or page contents are included.":{"*":[""]},"Website favicon":{"*":[""]},"ChatAI logo (adapts to the theme)":{"*":[""]},"ChatAI logo, dark":{"*":[""]},"ChatAI logo, light":{"*":[""]},"Assistant icon, outlined":{"*":[""]},"Assistant icon, filled":{"*":[""]},"Assistant icon, colorful":{"*":[""]},"Custom icon":{"*":[""]},"Pin":{"*":[""]},"Back and Forward":{"*":[""]},"\"Custom address…\" entry in the selector":{"*":[""]},"Panel icon:":{"*":[""]},"Panel icon":{"*":[""]},"Assistants without a dedicated icon fall back to the ChatAI logo.":{"*":[""]},"Custom icon:":{"*":[""]},"Choose custom icon":{"*":[""]},"Toolbar buttons:":{"*":[""]},"Hidden buttons remain available in the ⋮ menu where it makes sense. Auto-hide and Downloads always live in the ⋮ menu; a download indicator appears in the toolbar only while a download needs attention.":{"*":[""]},"Toolbar:":{"*":[""]},"Always hide the toolbar":{"*":[""]},"Theme:":{"*":[""]},"Colours, spacing and animations follow your Plasma theme. Pages receive a dark-mode hint when the theme is dark.":{"*":[""]},"Folder:":{"*":[""]},"Download folder":{"*":[""]},"Choose…":{"*":[""]},"Leave empty to use the system Downloads folder. Files are saved automatically with a sanitized name and are never executed.":{"*":[""]},"Current downloads":{"*":[""]},"Downloads are listed here while the ChatAI widget is open.":{"*":[""]},"No downloads in this session.":{"*":[""]},"Completed":{"*":[""]},"Downloading":{"*":[""]},"Waiting":{"*":[""]},"Clear Finished Downloads":{"*":[""]},"Assistant:":{"*":[""]},"The assistant shown when the widget opens and when you press Home":{"*":[""]},"Enable more assistants in the Sites page.":{"*":[""]},"Window:":{"*":[""]},"Keep the widget open when clicking outside (pin)":{"*":[""]},"Preload the assistant when Plasma starts":{"*":[""]},"Preloading makes the first opening instant but keeps the web engine in memory from login.":{"*":[""]},"Hide the toolbar":{"*":[""]},"Hide the toolbar automatically and reveal it on hover":{"*":[""]},"Links:":{"*":[""]},"Links that would open a new window are opened in your default browser. Sign-in pages stay inside ChatAI so logins keep working.":{"*":[""]},"Credits":{"*":[""]},"Ask per site":{"*":[""]},"Always allow":{"*":[""]},"Always block":{"*":[""]},"Notifications:":{"*":[""]},"Shown as Plasma notifications.":{"*":[""]},"Microphone:":{"*":[""]},"Voice input. Only active while a site you allowed is recording.":{"*":[""]},"Camera:":{"*":[""]},"Screen sharing:":{"*":[""]},"The primary screen is shared when allowed.":{"*":[""]},"Location:":{"*":[""]},"Read clipboard:":{"*":[""]},"Lets a page read what you copied. Pasting with Ctrl+V never needs this.":{"*":[""]},"Notifications":{"*":[""]},"Microphone":{"*":[""]},"Camera":{"*":[""]},"Camera and microphone":{"*":[""]},"Screen sharing":{"*":[""]},"Location":{"*":[""]},"Clipboard":{"*":[""]},"Mouse lock":{"*":[""]},"Local fonts":{"*":[""]},"Other":{"*":[""]},"Allowed":{"*":[""]},"Blocked":{"*":[""]},"Ask":{"*":[""]},"Unknown":{"*":[""]},"Default behaviour":{"*":[""]},"\"Ask per site\" shows a prompt inside ChatAI the first time a site requests the permission; the answer is remembered for that site.":{"*":[""]},"Saved site permissions":{"*":[""]},"Open the ChatAI widget to review the permissions saved per site. They are stored in the web engine profile.":{"*":[""]},"No site has saved permissions yet.":{"*":[""]},"Reset":{"*":[""]},"Ask again next time":{"*":[""]},"Reset All Site Permissions…":{"*":[""]},"Reset all site permissions?":{"*":[""]},"Every site will ask again the next time it needs a permission. Logins are not affected.":{"*":[""]},"Privacy: the microphone, camera, screen and location are only used after you allow them, and only by the site that asked. Login data belongs to the web engine profile (see Cache and Data). ChatAI does not read page contents or credentials.":{"*":[""]},"A custom site with this name or address already exists.":{"*":[""]},"Enter a name and a valid http:// or https:// address.":{"*":[""]},"Built-in assistants":{"*":[""]},"Enabled assistants appear in the toolbar selector. ChatAI embeds each service's official website; accounts, limits and features are controlled by the service.":{"*":[""]},"Login required":{"*":[""]},"Custom sites":{"*":[""]},"Add any chat website by name and address. Custom sites use the ChatAI icon and get no special access to your system.":{"*":[""]},"Name":{"*":[""]},"Site name":{"*":[""]},"Site address":{"*":[""]},"Save":{"*":[""]},"Add":{"*":[""]},"Cancel editing":{"*":[""]},"Edit":{"*":[""]},"Remove":{"*":[""]},"No custom sites added yet":{"*":[""]},"HTTP cache":{"*":[""]},"Size limit:":{"*":[""]},"Automatic":{"*":[""]},"%1 MiB":{"*":[""]},"Cache size limit":{"*":[""]},"Clearing…":{"*":[""]},"Clear Cache":{"*":[""]},"Open Cache Folder":{"*":[""]},"Open the ChatAI widget to clear the cache. Clearing removes downloaded page resources only; you stay signed in.":{"*":[""]},"Clearing removes downloaded page resources only; you stay signed in. Navigation is paused until it finishes.":{"*":[""]},"Site data and sessions":{"*":[""]},"Cookies, logins, local storage and per-site permissions live in the profile folder below. Qt WebEngine offers no way to wipe cookies from a widget while it is running: to end a session, use the site's own \"Sign out\", or switch to a new profile name. Site permissions can be reset in the Permissions page.":{"*":[""]},"WebEngine profile":{"*":[""]},"Each storage name is a separate folder with its own cookies, logins, cache and permissions. Use different names to keep separate accounts in different widget instances.":{"*":[""]},"Storage name:":{"*":[""]},"Storage name":{"*":[""]},"Apply":{"*":[""]},"Default":{"*":[""]},"Open Profile Folder":{"*":[""]},"Switch WebEngine profile?":{"*":[""]},"The assistant will reload using the profile \"%1\". You will be signed out of the current sessions until you sign in again; the data of the previous profile stays on disk and can be removed from its folder.":{"*":[""]},"Let pages write to the clipboard":{"*":[""]},"Needed by the \"Copy\" buttons of most assistants. Reading the clipboard is a separate permission.":{"*":[""]},"Let scripts paste from the clipboard":{"*":[""]},"Allows a page to read the clipboard without asking. Ctrl+V works without this. Off by default for privacy.":{"*":[""]},"Let pages open new windows":{"*":[""]},"New windows are intercepted: sign-in pages stay in ChatAI, other links open in your browser.":{"*":[""]},"Require a click before media plays":{"*":[""]},"Blocks autoplaying audio and video (including voice replies) until you interact with the page.":{"*":[""]},"Spatial navigation with arrow keys":{"*":[""]},"Move between links and fields with the arrow keys instead of Tab.":{"*":[""]},"Focus the page after navigating":{"*":[""]},"Lets you type immediately after the page loads. Disable if the page steals focus from the toolbar.":{"*":[""]},"Allow unknown link types after a click":{"*":[""]},"Lets a link you click open another application (for example mailto: or a custom scheme). Links opened by scripts are still blocked.":{"*":[""]},"These options change how the embedded web engine behaves for every assistant. Changes apply immediately.":{"*":[""]},"Sign in — %1":{"popup window title with host":[""]},"B":{"bytes":[""]},"kB":{"kilobytes":[""]},"MB":{"megabytes":[""]},"GB":{"gigabytes":[""]},"TB":{"terabytes":[""]},"%1 %2":{"file size: value and unit":[""]},"%1/s":{"transfer rate":[""]},"%1%":{"percentage":[""]}," · ":{"separator between download status parts":[""]},"Search":{"provider category":[""]},"Code":{"provider category":[""]},"Privacy":{"provider category":[""]},"Agents":{"provider category":[""]},"Open models":{"provider category":[""]},"Custom":{"provider category":[""]},"Mouse back / forward":{"mouse buttons":